## What this module is

The generated models and endpoint clients for the SIRIUS Nightsky API, and nothing else. The entry point
you actually use - `SiriusSDK`/`SiriusClient`, starting and locating a SIRIUS installation, the event
stream - lives one level up in [sirius-sdk](../README.md).

**Depend on `{{{groupId}}}:sirius-sdk`, not on `{{{artifactId}}}`.** This module comes along transitively;
on its own it gives you no way to find or start a SIRIUS instance. The
[parent README](../README.md#availability) has the dependency snippets and a getting-started example.

Building requires Java 21+ and Gradle. The module is generated and built as part of the SIRIUS monorepo;
there is no standalone Maven build.

